useredit - change a member's level and time limit (sysop / co-sysop)

usage: useredit [ID]

    With no ID it asks for the target ID.
    [1] level      … gen(general) / pro(probationary) / cos(co-sysop) / sys(sysop) / gst(guest)
    [2] time limit … minutes (65535 = unlimited)
    Enter saves and quits.
    Main use is raising probationary (pro) members to gen (approving sign-up).
